a brand new game.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:06.667
It's time for Wedding, Set, Go.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:08.133
-♪ Wedding ♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:11.400
♪ Wedding, set, go ♪

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:14.434
But I'm going to need some help.

00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:16.367
She is one of the biggest
stars in the world,

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.834
and her new movie, "Marry Me,"
is in theaters February 11,

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:23.033
Please welcome the one
and only Jennifer Lopez.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:27.334
-♪ Wedding, set, go ♪

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:28.667
-Oh, my goodness.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.033
Come here.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:32.801
Jennifer Lopez!

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:34.300
-Hi, guys.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.834
Okay.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:36.834
-I know every time --

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.133
-What do you have me
doing today?

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.234
-Every time you
come on this show --

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:42.033
-Showing up not dressed
appropriately.

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.634
I'm positive.
-You never are, yeah.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:45.534
But this one, I think
you'll like this one.

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:47.734
In honor
of the movie marry me, okay,

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.167
Jennifer and I
are going to face off

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.033
in some wedding-themed
challenges.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.834
Ever wins the most challenges,
wins the game.

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:54.501
Sound good?
-What do I win?

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:57.067
-Just pride.
-How hard am I trying right now?

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.167
-Come on, I know you.
You're very competitive.

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.133
This first challenge, we're
going to be catching a bouquet.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.801
Okay? But it's one flower
at a time.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.467
-Okay.
-Air cannons are going

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:06.534
to launch roses at us.
-Wait.

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:08.767
Do they have, like, thorns?
Wait?

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:09.968
-Yeah, look, don't worry
about the canons.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:11.467
-Canons?
-Don't worry about thrones.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:13.167
The stem will get you.

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:15.167
They're coming at you
pretty fast.

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:18.467
The whoever can catch the most
before time runs out wins.

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:21.334
Safety is sexy.
-Are you [bleep] kidding me?

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:23.367
-You can't say that.
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:24.701
You can't say that on
television.

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:25.834
Here we go.
This is...

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:27.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:28.634
You ready for this?

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:29.901
They're coming from all angles.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:31.334
So just whoever
can grab the most.

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:32.367
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:33.434
-Wedding, set...

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:35.634
-Wait, where is --
-...go!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.367
-Ow!

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:40.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.601
♪♪

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:46.267
-[ Shrieks ]

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:47.567
-Alright, stop!

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:49.767
-I got it, I got it!

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:51.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:52.767
[ Shrieks ]
-Alright, stop!

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:55.200
30 seconds.
There it goes again.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.167
30 seconds, stop, stop,
stop, stop.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:01:58.501
Stop!

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:00.434
What the...?
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:02.400
What the...?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.067
What in the world just happened?

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:06.767
-I can't see.
-I can't see.

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:08.834
-I felt like I was in
a fight right there.

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:10.834
That was -- I got punched.

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:12.567
-Did I punch you?
-No, you didn't punch me.

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:14.400
A rose hit from like all angles.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.234
They were aiming.
-I'm sorry if I punched you.

00:02:16.234 --> 00:02:18.067
-I got -- I got two.

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:19.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:20.901
Alright, so I think you won
the first challenge.

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.167
Congratulations

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:25.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.200
You did -- you did
knock me out of the way.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.434
-Because you got in my way.

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:29.467
-But then I got scared.

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:31.200
-It felt like you
were going to tackle me.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.801
-Oh, my --
How am I gonna tackle you?

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.167
-Alright, come over here.
-Okay.

00:02:34.167 --> 00:02:35.868
This is the -- this is the next
game we're going to play.

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.367
-What's this?
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:37.367 --> 00:02:38.367
What is this?

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:39.801
-This -- well, this one.

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:41.234
-I don't know what to do
with these.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.534
-Thank you very much.
-Because we were under attack.

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:44.734
-Oh, so sweet.
We were under attack.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.567
But you got my back there.

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:49.601
This one is -- this challenge
is called the threshold carry.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:52.334
Okay, we both have to carry
a weighted dummy...

00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:54.567
