-...through a door frame

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:59.000
and then -- and then toss it
as far as we can onto a bed.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.534
Now, whoever can throw
their dummy the furthest wins.

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:02.701
-Wha--

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:04.534
-Since you're our guest,
you can go first.

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.167
You can take -- you can take
the groom off there.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:07.367
-I have to take the groom?

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:08.601
-Yeah, you take the groom
and carry him

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:11.200
to the threshold.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.634
-Oh, my God. He's creepy.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:15.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.801 --> 00:03:17.701
-Here we go.

00:03:17.701 --> 00:03:19.634
-No, no.
-Oh, through this one here.

00:03:19.634 --> 00:03:20.901
-I thought you were
dancing with him.

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:23.300
-Wait, so how far close
can I get to the bed?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.267
-You can get a little closer.

00:03:25.267 --> 00:03:26.934
It's romantic already.

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:30.868
♪♪

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:32.901
Give it good toss,
however, you got to do it.

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:34.267
Heeyah!

00:03:34.267 --> 00:03:36.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:41.100
♪♪

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.868
Wow, that was a good toss.

00:03:42.868 --> 00:03:44.133
-I had the last line.

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:45.234
-That was a good toss.

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:46.334
Can we see that in slo-mo?

00:03:46.334 --> 00:03:48.067
[ Laughing ]
I hit the last line.

00:03:48.067 --> 00:03:49.601
-Look at this toss.

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:51.534
Wow!

00:03:51.534 --> 00:03:53.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.801
I mean...

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.100
-He was a 10-footer.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.701
-That's a 10-footer, isn't it?

00:03:57.701 --> 00:03:59.000
-It's a 10-footer.
-It's a 10-footer.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.100
Alright, here we go.
I got to beat that.

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.534
-Yeah.
Alright, get ready, Roots.

00:04:01.534 --> 00:04:03.667
I'm probably going
to toss it up to you guys.

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:07.033
♪♪

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:08.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:08.267 --> 00:04:10.234
♪♪

00:04:10.234 --> 00:04:11.801
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:11.801 --> 00:04:13.767
He's such a fool.

00:04:13.767 --> 00:04:15.400
-Honeybunch.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:20.834
♪♪

00:04:20.834 --> 00:04:23.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:23.601 --> 00:04:26.334
♪♪

00:04:26.334 --> 00:04:29.133
-Not happy.

00:04:29.133 --> 00:04:31.167
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:34.767
I think Jennifer
won by a foot, by a tiny...

00:04:34.767 --> 00:04:36.467
